# WP CI-SIGN-PIN-1: SHA-256 of the Android RELEASE signing certificate.
# Public value, not a secret: it is printed in every release body
# ("Verify this release") and by `apksigner verify --print-certs`.
# publish.yml (android-build, "Verify APK signature (apksigner)") refuses
# to publish a signed APK whose certificate differs from this pin.
#
# Exactly one line of 64 hex characters, or no value line at all ("pin not
# set": tag runs fail, other runs only warn). Comment lines start with '#'.
# How to fill or change it: app/README.md, "Pinned release certificate".
# Measured on v0.1.0-rc10, unchanged through v0.1.0-rc21.1.
f095d5abda5acb23f3f07c9fa68a5526a514f1f4e600fca17162aa8d17c66172
